			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-728288">
									

<p>This can be recovered with some editing. It has an excellent base concept. The idea that this could happen to anyone, for no explained reason, and the part about how the dying researcher could interact with 451… Just chilling.</p>
<p>Suggestions:<br />
-Make him more resigned and prone to paranoia, and less suicidal. Actually, here's what to do- one time, he sees a gun lying around, and randomly tries to shoot himself, only to have the researcher get shot and the rest of the events happen. Just say it's a a sudden thing.<br />
-He should be contained -somehow-. I'm not sure how you can do that and still have the rest of the article intact, but he does need to be contained. Hm… Maybe, after he entered, he just can't leave Site 19? You'll have to think about it.<br />
-Second paragraph of the Description: Revise it for appropriate clinical tone, look through some other articles for how to structure the concepts if you're not sure.<br />
-Move the part mentioning the linked document to the bottom of the page, like in other SCPs.</p>

