														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-728462">
									

<p>I love the concept here. It's really a double-whammy, including both his torment at believing himself responsible for the destruction of humanity and being utterly alone, and the Foundation having to keep him from letting some super-dangerous SCP out of its cage. The most obvious change I could suggest is to replace "ignored" with "misinterpreted". If he's "ignoring" attempts to contain or communicate with him, that sounds Sue-ish. Also, RhettSarlin's idea is good.</p>

